<span id="A4.I20.i2.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I20.i2.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Category Error:</span><span id="A4.I20.i2.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Specificity mismatch (Blue vs Dark Blue).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I20.i2.I1.i2.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">*</span> 
